🏨 Accommodation Module
The Accommodation Module is designed to simplify guest stay management for events. It helps organizers assign rooms, track availability, and manage special requests — ensuring every attendee has a comfortable experience.

✨ Features
Room Allocation: Automatically assign rooms based on guest preferences and availability.

Booking Management: Track check-in/check-out dates, cancellations, and modifications.

Guest Profiles: Store details like dietary needs, accessibility requirements, and VIP status.

Cost Tracking: Calculate accommodation expenses and generate invoices.

Integration: Connect with the main Event Management System for seamless guest handling.
